--[ DESCRIPTION ] ------------------
libgav1 is a Main profile (0), High profile (1) & Professional profile (2)
compliant AV1 decoder. More information on the AV1 video format can be found at
aomedia.org.

This copy was taken from the webrtc checkout of chromium (chromium webrtc).

--[ UPDATING ] ------------------
This repository should be updated by taking a clean snapshot from the webrtc
checkout of chromium. Details on how to obtain webrtc can be found here:
https://webrtc.github.io/webrtc-org/native-code/development/

